Elimination of EC2 Idle Waste
In the previous EC2 model, the cluster maintained running instances whether or not any tenant had an active DBT run. A cluster with 3 tenants and 3 EC2 instances was billing for all 3 instances at 3am even if the last DBT run completed at 11pm.
With Fargate: when there are no running tasks, there is no compute cost. Each tenant’s task provisions compute on demand, uses it, and releases it. The platform has zero idle compute spend.

